00:07:24,230 --> 00:07:26,410
this diagram should be quite familiar to all of you.

217
00:07:26,410 --> 00:07:27,650
Basically, we

218
00:07:27,650 --> 00:07:29,670
no matter how complex your project is,

219
00:07:29,670 --> 00:07:30,750
actually the whole

220
00:07:30,750 --> 00:07:32,690
compilation and linking process

221
00:07:32,690 --> 00:07:33,690
It's all pretty much like this

222
00:07:33,690 --> 00:07:34,990
a diagram like this one

